<!-- 终端标签：终端视图 + 状态提示（启动中、退出、断开）。快捷键与指针在视图的 code-behind 中转交给视图模型。 -->
<UserControl xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:vm="using:TCode.Desktop.ViewModels"
             xmlns:tv="using:TCode.Terminal.Avalonia"
             xmlns:loc="using:TCode.Desktop.Localization"
             xmlns:atom="https://atomui.net"
             xmlns:icons="using:TCode.Desktop.Icons"
             x:Class="TCode.Desktop.Views.TerminalTabView"
             x:DataType="vm:TerminalTabViewModel">
    <Grid RowDefinitions="*,Auto">
        <tv:TerminalView x:Name="Terminal" Grid.Row="0" Snapshot="{Binding Frame}" Padding="8" ClipToBounds="True" />
        <Border Grid.Row="0" IsVisible="{Binding Status, Converter={x:Static StringConverters.IsNotNullOrEmpty}}"
                VerticalAlignment="Bottom" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Padding="12,6" Background="#CC1E1E1E">
            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Status}" Foreground="#D4D4D4" FontSize="12" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
        </Border>
        <!-- 搜索栏（⌘F 打开；Esc 关闭；Enter / Shift+Enter 切换匹配）：浮在终端右上角 -->
        <Border Grid.Row="0" IsVisible="{Binding IsSearchOpen}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                Margin="0,8,12,0" Padding="6,4" CornerRadius="6" Background="#F02A2A2A" BorderBrush="#3C3C3C" BorderThickness="1">
            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,160,Auto,Auto,Auto,Auto" ColumnSpacing="4">
                <icons:LucideIcon Grid.Column="0" Kind="Search" Width="13" Height="13" StrokeBrush="#A0A0A0" Margin="4,0,2,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                <atom:LineEdit x:Name="SearchBox" Grid.Column="1" SizeType="Small" StyleVariant="Borderless" Background="Transparent"
                               PlaceholderText="{loc:TCodeLangResource TerminalSearchPlaceholder}"
                               Text="{Binding SearchText, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" />
                <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding SearchCountText}" Foreground="#A0A0A0" FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center" MinWidth="36" TextAlignment="Right" />
                <Button Grid.Column="3" Theme="{StaticResource TCode.RowButton}" Width="24" MinHeight="24" Padding="0"
                        ToolTip.Tip="{loc:TCodeLangResource TerminalSearchPrevious}" Command="{Binding StepSearchPreviousCommand}">
                    <icons:LucideIcon Kind="ChevronDown" Width="12" Height="12" RenderTransform="rotate(180deg)" />
                </Button>
                <Button Grid.Column="4" Theme="{StaticResource TCode.RowButton}" Width="24" MinHeight="24" Padding="0"
                        ToolTip.Tip="{loc:TCodeLangResource TerminalSearchNext}" Command="{Binding StepSearchNextCommand}">
                    <icons:LucideIcon Kind="ChevronDown" Width="12" Height="12" />
                </Button>
                <Button Grid.Column="5" Theme="{StaticResource TCode.RowButton}" Width="24" MinHeight="24" Padding="0"
                        ToolTip.Tip="{loc:TCodeLangResource TerminalSearchClose}" Command="{Binding CloseSearchBarCommand}">
                    <icons:LucideIcon Kind="X" Width="12" Height="12" />
                </Button>
            </Grid>
        </Border>

        <!-- 需要确认的操作（粘贴含换行的内容、关闭仍在运行的程序） -->
        <Border Grid.Row="0" IsVisible="{Binding HasPrompt}" VerticalAlignment="Bottom" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                Padding="12,8" Background="#F01E1E1E" BorderBrush="#3C3C3C" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0">
            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto,Auto" ColumnSpacing="8">
                <TextBlock Text="{Binding PromptMessage}" Foreground="#D4D4D4" FontSize="12" TextWrapping="Wrap" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                <Button Grid.Column="1" Content="{loc:TCodeLangResource Cancel}" Command="{Binding CancelPromptCommand}" />
                <Button Grid.Column="2" Content="{Binding PromptActionText}" Command="{Binding ConfirmPromptCommand}" />
            </Grid>
        </Border>
    </Grid>
</UserControl>
